<!--
    Sick leave is implemented as a regular 120-day allocation per service year
    (date_from = service anniversary, date_to = next anniversary minus 1 day).
    Odoo's accrual plan mechanism is NOT used because its yearly frequency anchors
    to a fixed calendar date (January 1) rather than per-employee service anniversaries.
    Auto-allocation and renewal are handled by the daily cron in hr_employee.py.
-->
</odoo>
